    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321900/extras/0d6b4254bf503ade3deb5e6b936352db.avif?t=1726201524\" /></span><br><br><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding</strong><br>Create a unique deck that suits your playstyle and strategy. There's no randomness in the building of your deck. Your strategy and choices determine your path to victory.<br><br><strong>RPG Elements</strong> <br>Define your character's identity by unlocking skills, attributes, and specializations (100+). Play as a cunning rogue, an armored knight, a powerful sorcerer, or anything in between. The choice is yours.<br><br><strong>Friendly Shopkeepers</strong><br>A selection of fully-voiced shopkeepers to comment on your choices and progress (1500+ lines in total).<br><br><strong>Dynamic Equipment System</strong> <br>Spend your hard-earned gold on new gear from a selection of over 70 items, but remember - equipment degrades over time, so choose wisely and manage your resources carefully.<br><br><strong>Challenging Opponents</strong> <br>Face off against 30 unique opponents that will force you to change your strategy.<br><br><strong>High Stakes Combat</strong><br>With a small health pool, every fight matters. Pay close attention to each round, as a single mistake could be your downfall.<br><br><strong>Customizable Difficulty</strong><br>Whether you're a deckbuilding novice or a seasoned veteran, Archons: Arena has you covered. Adjust the difficulty to keep the game challenging, fun, and accessible.<br><br><strong>In-Game Editor</strong><br>Edit and extend the game to your liking, and test your changes within the same session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321900/extras/995653b448cb4b3fcf822cc9d94195e2.poster.avif?t=1726201524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321900/extras/995653b448cb4b3fcf822cc9d94195e2.webm?t=1726201524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321900/extras/995653b448cb4b3fcf822cc9d94195e2.mp4?t=1726201524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321900/extras/0d6b4254bf503ade3deb5e6b936352db.avif?t=1726201524\" /></span><br><br><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding</strong><br>Create a unique deck that suits your playstyle and strategy. There's no randomness in the building of your deck. Your strategy and choices determine your path to victory.<br><br><strong>RPG Elements</strong> <br>Define your character's identity by unlocking skills, attributes, and specializations (100+). Play as a cunning rogue, an armored knight, a powerful sorcerer, or anything in between. The choice is yours.<br><br><strong>Friendly Shopkeepers</strong><br>A selection of fully-voiced shopkeepers to comment on your choices and progress (1500+ lines in total).<br><br><strong>Dynamic Equipment System</strong> <br>Spend your hard-earned gold on new gear from a selection of over 70 items, but remember - equipment degrades over time, so choose wisely and manage your resources carefully.<br><br><strong>Challenging Opponents</strong> <br>Face off against 30 unique opponents that will force you to change your strategy.<br><br><strong>High Stakes Combat</strong><br>With a small health pool, every fight matters. Pay close attention to each round, as a single mistake could be your downfall.<br><br><strong>Customizable Difficulty</strong><br>Whether you're a deckbuilding novice or a seasoned veteran, Archons: Arena has you covered. Adjust the difficulty to keep the game challenging, fun, and accessible.<br><br><strong>In-Game Editor</strong><br>Edit and extend the game to your liking, and test your changes within the same session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321900/extras/995653b448cb4b3fcf822cc9d94195e2.poster.avif?t=1726201524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea